-                      "--chunk_size", str(5000),
+                      "--chunk_size", str(250),

This resource-only patch changes the number of query sequences passed to each
EPA-NG chunk for both bacterial and archaeal placements. It does not alter the
reference alignments, trees, substitution models, placement algorithm,
hidden-state prediction, NSTI threshold, copy-number normalization, MinPath, or
MetaCyc pathway inference. It was required because the PICRUSt2 2.6.3 wrapper
hard-codes a chunk size of 5,000, which exceeded the 14-GiB cgroup memory limit
for this 23,896-ASV full-length 16S dataset.
